  "id": "social-density",
  "term": "social density",
  "definition": "Social density is the degree of crowding or concentration of others in an individual's social environment, such as living in a higher- versus lower-density group or colony. In the source, differences in social density are treated as differences in how socially competitive or stressful the environment is.",
